 *    Rukn_Al_Zain_SEO_Content_Brief.docx. Treat as PROVISIONAL and confirm
 *    against real product test data / manufacturer certificates before go-live.
 *  - STRUCTURED DATA: a single combined @graph (BreadcrumbList + Product +
 *    FAQPage) is emitted inline. The request supplied BreadcrumbList + FAQPage;
 *    the Product node is added per CLAUDE.md §5 (Product schema on every product
 *    page). Organization JSON-LD is emitted sitewide by BaseLayout.
 *
 * ─── IMAGE ASSETS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * public/images/acoustic-soundproofing-flooring/ — intrinsic dimensions wired
 * below to prevent layout shift:
 *   - zainacoustic-underlayment-roll.jpg          (hero, 1024×1024)
 *   - zainacoustic-problem-solution-diagram.jpg   (landscape, 1408×768)
