 *   - high-rise-apartment-acoustic-flooring.jpg   (landscape, 1408×768)
 * public/ images use <img> (astro:assets <Image /> only optimises src/assets).
 * TODO: convert to optimised WebP; add a purpose-built 1200×630 OG card
