<BaseLayout
  title="Acoustic Underlay Dubai | Impact Sound Insulation UAE | Rukn Al Zain"
  description="High-performance acoustic sound insulation underlayment in Dubai. Reduces impact sound transmission under marble, tile, engineered wood, and vinyl flooring."
